  "transformations": [
    "Historical top-level PoseSplit paper, source ZIP, figures and descriptive metadata moved into a dated archive; original legacy numerical results and frozen implementations retain their repository paths.",
    "Frozen EventOwner code/protocol, per-pair results and source manifests copied byte-identically.",
    "Added portable orchestration, a saved-result verifier, fresh numerical plots and a new ACM single-column manuscript.",
    "Only two lossless procedural scenes and one illustrative preview accompany the compact release; other procedural media regenerate from state.",
    "Real raw recordings and participant photographs are not redistributed.",
    "Bibliography checked against primary arXiv, Sony and NVIDIA records; FlatSounds first author is Tingle Li and SAVGBench/STARSS23 first author Kazuki Shimada.",
    "Added a Methods AI-assistance disclosure for Codex use under the author\u2019s direction; no other manuscript source, bibliography, figures, code or experimental data changed."
